##	History:
##		- 20261011 tt: Created. add, passwd, migrate, status.
##		- 20261012 tt: migrate skips a symlinked .cache, tmp or var, puts everything back if it fails partway,
##		  and sets the automount property last. It uses the watchdog's logged-in test, plus any process.
